---
# Google C++ Style, with two deliberate deviations:
#   - the column limit is widened to 100 to match the existing codebase;
#   - includes keep the order they were written in, because that order decides
#     which transitive declarations a translation unit sees, and the formatter
#     cannot know that.
BasedOnStyle: Google
ColumnLimit: 100
SortIncludes: false
...
